// Per weapon: what one shot does, how a press becomes rounds, how the cone
// grows as it fires, and how far a bolt flies and how its damage fades.
// The pistol is the accurate single shot with the longer reach; the carbine
// a burst weapon whose damage is best up close.
//
// mode: Single (a round a press), Burst(count, gap) (a press commits to
// count rounds gap seconds apart) or Auto (a round every interval while
// held). interval is the least time between shots, or between a burst's
// last round and the next burst's first.
// hold: with it, a trigger still down when a burst's last round has left
// keeps firing a round every gap seconds, each adding bloom degrees to the
// cone on top of the row's own.
// spread and aim_spread are the half angle, in degrees, of the cone a bolt
// leaves in from the hip and while aiming. bloom: degrees a round adds, the
// most the added cone may reach, seconds before it settles, degrees a
// second it settles by. move_spread: degrees added at a full run.
// range: metres a bolt flies. falloff: all damage up to full metres, a line
// down to share of it at far, share from there to the range.
// aim_time: seconds the cone takes to close from spread to aim_spread once
// aim is held, and to open again once it is dropped (nought steps at once).
// zoom: how many times the aimed view magnifies (the client reads it alone).
// The rifle is the long gun: one slow hard shot, tight only when aimed and
// still, and the only row that owns the range past 50 m.
(
    version: 7,
    weapons: {
        Carbine: (
            interval: 0.42,
            bolt_speed: 45.0,
            damage: 24.0,
            posture: 15.0,
            magazine: 24,
            reload: 1.35,
            spread: 4.0,
            aim_spread: 2.0,
            mode: Burst(count: 3, gap: 0.09),
            hold: Some((gap: 0.12, bloom: 0.4)),
            bloom: (shot: 0.25, cap: 4.0, wait: 0.15, settle: 6.0),
            move_spread: 1.0,
            range: 70.0,
            falloff: (full: 25.0, far: 50.0, share: 0.55),
            aim_time: 0.0,
            zoom: 1.0,
        ),
        Pistol: (
            interval: 0.32,
            bolt_speed: 60.0,
            damage: 24.0,
            posture: 16.0,
            magazine: 10,
            reload: 0.9,
            spread: 2.4,
            aim_spread: 1.0,
            mode: Single,
            bloom: (shot: 0.6, cap: 2.5, wait: 0.20, settle: 4.0),
            move_spread: 0.3,
            range: 90.0,
            falloff: (full: 30.0, far: 60.0, share: 0.6),
            aim_time: 0.0,
            zoom: 1.0,
        ),
        Rifle: (
            interval: 1.8,
            bolt_speed: 140.0,
            damage: 85.0,
            posture: 55.0,
            magazine: 4,
            reload: 2.4,
            spread: 7.0,
            aim_spread: 0.25,
            mode: Single,
            bloom: (shot: 2.5, cap: 3.0, wait: 0.5, settle: 4.0),
            move_spread: 3.0,
            range: 260.0,
            falloff: (full: 150.0, far: 260.0, share: 0.7),
            aim_time: 0.875,
            zoom: 3.5,
        ),
    },
)
